			+ "Two possible endings:\n"
			+ "• TOTAL POLYMORPHIA — survive 12 rotations holding Bio ≥ 8, Ω ≥ 0.35 and $ ≥ 300K.\n"
			+ "• CHAOS TAMER — accumulate enough economic power ($ in millions) through the chaos."
