			+ "• [b]Nodos[/b]: los 9 upgrades. [b]Click derecho[/b] conecta 5 de micelio (máx. 20 por nodo); [b]Shift + click derecho[/b] lo desconecta.\n"
			+ "• Cada nodo conectado: lo que aportan sus niveles × (1 + conexión/20) — hasta ×2 — y su costo −1.5% por punto (−30% lleno).\n"
			+ "• [b]Un nodo lleno se autocompra[/b] cuando alcanza la plata: la red lo ve.\n"
			+ "• [b]Deriva[/b]: el micelio libre fluye solo, 1 punto cada 10 s, al upgrade más comprado.\n\n"
			+ "[b]Sello[/b]: los 9 nodos llenos (180 de micelio: hacen falta ~30 hifas) sostenidos 60 s → [b]MICELIO OMNISCIENTE[/b] (+9 PL base + bonus).\n\n"
			+ "[b]Recompensa[/b]: [b]Legado: Nodo Latente[/b] — el primer nodo que llenaste queda conectado en todas las runs (lo que aportan sus niveles ×1.25)."
		),
		"body_en": (
			"Transmutation (A → A+) of [b]Mycelial Network[/b]. The key is bought in the Genetic Bank (15 LP, after closing Sporulation). With the Mycelial Network active the [b][T] Revert[/b] button appears (it disappears once the primordium has started). On reverting, the network is [b]digested[/b] into free mycelium (at least 60) and the chosen branch is undone.\n\n"
			+ "You give up the ×2.5 passive, the ×0.5 click, the branch choice and the Sporulation ending. In exchange, [b]the network stops growing outward and starts seeing everything from within[/b]:\n\n"
			+ "• [b]Free mycelium[/b]: grows with hyphae (0.05 per hypha per second) up to a cap of 60 + 4 per hypha (free + connected).\n"
			+ "• [b]Nodes[/b]: the 9 upgrades. [b]Right click[/b] connects 5 mycelium (max 20 per node); [b]Shift + right click[/b] disconnects it.\n"
			+ "• Each connected node: what its levels contribute × (1 + connection/20) — up to ×2 — and its cost −1.5% per point (−30% when full).\n"
			+ "• [b]A full node buys itself[/b] once you can afford it: the network sees it.\n"
			+ "• [b]Drift[/b]: free mycelium flows on its own, 1 point every 10 s, to the most-bought upgrade.\n\n"
			+ "[b]Seal[/b]: all 9 nodes full (180 mycelium: you need ~30 hyphae) sustained for 60 s → [b]OMNISCIENT MYCELIUM[/b] (+9 LP base + bonus).\n\n"
			+ "[b]Reward[/b]: [b]Legacy: Latent Node[/b] — the first node you filled stays connected in every run (what its levels contribute ×1.25)."
		),
		"unlock": {"type": "buff_owned", "id": "transmut_micelio"},
		"see_also": ["transmut_intro", "transmut_coro", "transmut_caos"],
	},
	"transmut_huesped": {
		"cat": "transmutaciones",
		"name_es": "Huésped Soberano", "name_en": "Sovereign Host",
		"body_es": (
			"Transmutación (A → A+) de [b]Parasitismo[/b]. La llave se compra en el Banco Genético (15 PL, tras cerrar Parasitismo). Parasitismo dura segundos, así que con la llave [b]espera tu decisión[/b]: el botón [b][T] Revertir[/b] aparece 3 veces en 80 s mientras el parásito sigue drenando. Al revertir, la biomasa robada se [b]digiere[/b] en la despensa (1 comida cada 2 de biomasa).\n\n"
			+ "Renunciás al crecimiento de biomasa ×2, al drenaje y a los finales de Parasitismo. A cambio, [b]el huésped domestica a su parásito[/b]:\n\n"
			+ "• [b]Hambre[/b] (0–100): sube sola, más rápido cuanto más confía. [b][Q] Alimentar[/b]: −30 (gasta una comida de la despensa; sin despensa, el 4% de tu dinero).\n"
			+ "• [b]Banda 25–75[/b]: la [b]confianza[/b] sube. Por encima, [b]muerde[/b] (corrosión). Por debajo, empachado y perezoso: la confianza baja.\n"
			+ "• [b]Antojos[/b]: cada 30–50 s el hambre salta +15, con aviso 4 s antes.\n"
			+ "• [b]Regalos[/b]: cada 20 s en banda, (5 × nivel) s de ingreso; el trueque sube ×(1 + 0.2 × nivel).\n\n"
			+ "[b]Sello[/b]: confianza nivel 5 (600) → [b]HUÉSPED SOBERANO[/b] (+9 PL base + bonus).\n\n"
			+ "[b]Recompensa[/b]: [b]Legado: Pacto Soberano[/b] — en todas las runs, la corrosión de Parasitismo avanza a la mitad."
		),
		"body_en": (
			"Transmutation (A → A+) of [b]Parasitism[/b]. The key is bought in the Genetic Bank (15 LP, after closing Parasitism). Parasitism lasts seconds, so with the key it [b]waits for your decision[/b]: the [b][T] Revert[/b] button appears 3 times within 80 s while the parasite keeps draining. On reverting, the stolen biomass is [b]digested[/b] into the pantry (1 meal per 2 biomass).\n\n"
			+ "You give up the ×2 biomass growth, the drain and the Parasitism endings. In exchange, [b]the host tames its parasite[/b]:\n\n"
			+ "• [b]Hunger[/b] (0–100): rises on its own, faster the more it trusts you. [b][Q] Feed[/b]: −30 (uses a pantry meal; with an empty pantry, 4% of your money).\n"
			+ "• [b]Band 25–75[/b]: [b]trust[/b] rises. Above, it [b]bites[/b] (corrosion). Below, overfed and lazy: trust drops.\n"
			+ "• [b]Cravings[/b]: every 30–50 s hunger jumps +15, with a 4 s warning.\n"
			+ "• [b]Gifts[/b]: every 20 s in band, (5 × level) s of income; barter rises ×(1 + 0.2 × level).\n\n"
			+ "[b]Seal[/b]: trust level 5 (600) → [b]SOVEREIGN HOST[/b] (+9 LP base + bonus).\n\n"
			+ "[b]Reward[/b]: [b]Legacy: Sovereign Pact[/b] — in every run, Parasitism's corrosion advances at half speed."
		),
		"unlock": {"type": "buff_owned", "id": "transmut_huesped"},
		"see_also": ["transmut_intro", "transmut_micelio", "transmut_coro"],
	},
	"ayuno_primordial": {
		"cat": "transmutaciones",
		"name_es": "Ayuno Primordial", "name_en": "Primal Fast",
		"body_es": (
			"[b]Sombra[/b] (A → anti-A) de [b]Hiperasimilación[/b]. La llave se compra en el Banco Genético (20 PL). No hay botón: Hiperasimilación es clickear frenético, y el Ayuno es [b]renunciar a clickear[/b]. Con la llave, si dejás de clickear 60 s teniendo un pasivo propio (≥ 10/s) y ε < 0.10, el hongo empieza a ayunar (te avisa 10 s antes: un click lo evita).\n\n"
			+ "[b]Mecánica central:[/b] abandonás el consumo. La biomasa drena activamente (2/s + 20%/s). A cambio acumulás [b]Silencio (S)[/b] cuando B es bajo y ε es bajo. El pasivo vale ×(1 + S×0.01).\n\n"
			+ "Botones activos:\n"
			+ "• [b][Q] Romper el Ayuno[/b]: liberás todo el S como burst de producción (×(1+S/50) durante 15 s). Reset de S=0 y un spike de B+5.\n"
			+ "• [b][W] Ascesis[/b]: mejora la tasa de acumulación de S en +15% por nivel.\n\n"
			+ "Condiciones de sello:\n"
			+ "• Ciclos (usos de Romper) ≥ 5\n"
			+ "• S acumulado total ≥ 500\n"
			+ "• Racha de silencio (B<1 y ε<0.10 consecutivos) ≥ 180 s\n\n"
			+ "[b]Recompensa al sellar:[/b] [b]Primicia del Vacío[/b] — al inicio de cada run, el pasivo arranca ×3 y decae a ×1 en 10 minutos.\n\n"
			+ "[i]Cuidado: el parásito acecha a quien deja de moverse demasiado tiempo.[/i]"
		),
		"body_en": (
			"[b]Shadow[/b] (A → anti-A) of [b]Hyperassimilation[/b]. The key is bought in the Genetic Bank (20 LP). There is no button: Hyperassimilation is frantic clicking, and the Fast is [b]giving up clicking[/b]. With the key, if you stop clicking for 60 s while having your own passive income (≥ 10/s) and ε < 0.10, the fungus begins to fast (you are warned 10 s before: one click prevents it).\n\n"
			+ "[b]Core mechanic:[/b] you abandon consumption. Biomass drains actively (2/s + 20%/s). In return you accumulate [b]Silence (S)[/b] while B and ε are low. Passive income = ×(1 + S×0.01).\n\n"
			+ "Active buttons:\n"
			+ "• [b][Q] Break the Fast[/b]: release all S as a production burst (×(1+S/50) for 15 s). Resets S=0 and spikes B+5.\n"
			+ "• [b][W] Ascesis[/b]: improves S accumulation rate by +15% per level.\n\n"
			+ "Seal conditions:\n"
			+ "• Cycles (uses of Break the Fast) ≥ 5\n"
			+ "• Total accumulated S ≥ 500\n"
			+ "• Silence streak (B<1 and ε<0.10 consecutive) ≥ 180 s\n\n"
			+ "[b]Reward on sealing:[/b] [b]Primacy of Void[/b] — at the start of each run, passive income starts at ×3 and decays to ×1 over 10 minutes.\n\n"
			+ "[i]Beware: the parasite stalks those who stay still for too long.[/i]"
		),
		"unlock": {"type": "route_closed", "route": "AYUNO PRIMORDIAL"},
		"see_also": ["transmut_fusion", "transmut_intro", "hiperasimilacion", "formula_produccion"],
	},

